{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOULSLIKE METROIDVANIA \u2014 WITH WINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>|\u00a0<strong>Soar. Explore. Conquer!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted <strong>2D action-RPG</strong> <strong>metroidvania </strong>where you <strong>fly</strong>, <strong>fight</strong>, and <strong>forge your legacy</strong> through a seamless world shaped by darkness and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly interconnected realm with <strong>no loading screens</strong>. Master strategic <strong>soulslike combat\u00a0</strong>\u2014 on land and in the skies. <strong>Absorb the essence</strong> of your enemies to evolve, <strong>combine elemental Natures</strong> to <strong>cast powerful spells</strong>, and uncover a haunting, immersive lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1772652957\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Light of the Darkness: ORIGINS is a <strong>2D action-RPG</strong> that fuses <strong>soulslike combat</strong> with <strong>metroidvania exploration</strong> \u2014 and introduces a rare, <strong>physics-based flying mechanic</strong> that completely transforms how you experience the world, in a universe where <strong>Castlevania meets Legacy of Kain</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <i><strong>Sephius</strong></i>, the first and only hybrid born from Light and Darkness, you\u2019ll traverse the treacherous Lands of Oblivion, a dimension caught between two warring realms. Rejected by both sides, you\u2019ll battle enemies in the air and on the ground, absorb their Essence, and grow stronger with every decision you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft spell combos, explore without interruptions, and discover a world with rich lore, atmospheric art and a soundtrack that pulls you into this universe. Dive in, and let destiny guide your wings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1772652957\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SEAMLESS WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a seamless and interconnected world.\u00a0Zoom in to fight. Zoom out to plan. The game never stops running.\u00a0<i>Perhaps even use this for your strategies and creativity...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/6fee134ad14711cfc7823a7270a730c5.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/6fee134ad14711cfc7823a7270a730c5.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/6fee134ad14711cfc7823a7270a730c5.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLIGHT CHANGES EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0physics-based, built for fluid control (especially on gamepad), <i><strong>soar, glide, dive, or hover\u00a0at anytime</strong></i>, with no cooldowns, or scripts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0c9ac21212f36ced33446d0d08399929.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0c9ac21212f36ced33446d0d08399929.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0c9ac21212f36ced33446d0d08399929.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge </strong>with precision. Choose between <strong>weapons </strong>and <strong>spells </strong>\u2014 each with range, cost, and risk.\u00a0Strike from <strong>above </strong>to catch enemies off guard, or unleash spells <strong>mid-air</strong> for tactical advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/dd4e3394dac5049580d382bd77a256d3.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/dd4e3394dac5049580d382bd77a256d3.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/dd4e3394dac5049580d382bd77a256d3.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSORB. EVOLVE. CAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and <strong>absorb their Essence</strong>\u00a0as your source of stamina and magical power.\u00a0Each opponent\u00a0carries a unique <strong>Nature</strong>, absorb them to unlock spells that reflect their elemental origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine different Natures</strong> to forge powerful new spells. <i><strong>And beware:</strong></i>\u00a0casting the wrong spell\u00a0can\u00a0be more beneficial to your enemy rather than yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>stamina </strong>to fight, fly, and grow. Use <strong>mana </strong>to fuel spells with raw arcane force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/371c59779c132eedd2ba2d592e4d385b.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/371c59779c132eedd2ba2d592e4d385b.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/371c59779c132eedd2ba2d592e4d385b.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REWARDS FOT THE RELENTLESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|\u00a0<i>The world doesn\u2019t give. It offers for those who seek and dare.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner. Backtrack through biomes to find enemies that\u00a0<strong>replenish your stamina</strong> and <strong>mana </strong>reserves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>hidden items</strong> that boost your attributes \u2014 and fragments of a deep, ancient lore waiting to be pieced together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/5acec6e626c0f4431d080b0f99f81402.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/5acec6e626c0f4431d080b0f99f81402.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/5acec6e626c0f4431d080b0f99f81402.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY CARVED IN LIGHT AND DARKNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened with no memory, you must recover your lost self by absorbing the Essence of others and uncovering the truth behind your creation.\u00a0<i><strong>The deeper you go, the more you remember. But some memories are dangerous \u2014 and some truths, better left buried.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0615107aab219448d798b92849aaedb7.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0615107aab219448d798b92849aaedb7.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0615107aab219448d798b92849aaedb7.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1772652957\" width=962 height=175 /></span><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted, <strong>interconnected world</strong> with <strong>no loading screens</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based flight</strong> as a core mechanic \u2014 no scripts, no cooldowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical combat </strong>with dodge timing, stamina management, and weapon/spell strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence absorption system</strong> \u2014 progress by defeating enemies and harnessing their Natures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental affinity system</strong> \u2014 casting the wrong spell can backfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy-specific behavior</strong> \u2014 spells and weapons interact differently depending on their Nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven progression</strong> with memory fragments and lore-based exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for gamepad</strong> \u2014 responsive movement and fluid control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive soundtrack</strong> and <strong>atmospheric sound design</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1772652957\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2490890?t=1772652957","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772652957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/67603bcc10665fc8aea087cf47addb77f60cf40a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772652957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/67603bcc10665fc8aea087cf47addb77f60cf40a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772652957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2659260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOULSLIKE METROIDVANIA \u2014 WITH WINGS</