 </strong>to fuel spells with raw arcane force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/371c59779c132eedd2ba2d592e4d385b.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/371c59779c132eedd2ba2d592e4d385b.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/371c59779c132eedd2ba2d592e4d385b.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REWARDS FOT THE RELENTLESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|\u00a0<i>The world doesn\u2019t give. It offers for those who seek and dare.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner. Backtrack through biomes to find enemies that\u00a0<strong>replenish your stamina</strong> and <strong>mana </strong>reserves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>hidden items</strong> that boost your attributes \u2014 and fragments of a deep, ancient lore waiting to be pieced together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/5acec6e626c0f4431d080b0f99f81402.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/5acec6e626c0f4431d080b0f99f81402.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/5acec6e626c0f4431d080b0f99f81402.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY CARVED IN LIGHT AND DARKNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened with no memory, you must recover your lost self by absorbing the Essence of others and uncovering the truth behind your creation.\u00a0<i><strong>The deeper you go, the more you remember. But some memories are dangerous \u2014 and some truths, better left buried.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0615107aab219448d798b92849aaedb7.poster.avif?t=1772652957\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0615107aab219448d798b92849aaedb7.webm?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/0615107aab219448d798b92849aaedb7.mp4?t=1772652957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1772652957\" width=962 height=175 /></span><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted, <strong>interconnected world</strong> with <strong>no loading screens</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based flight</strong> as a core mechanic \u2014 no scripts, no cooldowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical combat </strong>with dodge timing, stamina management, and weapon/spell strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence absorption system</strong> \u2014 progress by defeating enemies and harnessing their Natures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental affinity system</strong> \u2014 casting the wrong spell can backfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy-specific behavior</strong> \u2014 spells and weapons interact differently depending on their Nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven progression</strong> with memory fragments and lore-based exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for gamepad</strong> \u2014 responsive movement and fluid control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive soundtrack</strong> and <strong>atmospheric sound design</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1772652957\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["QUARTOMUNDO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/10fcd5ff4812237713b23f8322b0ed4025666e59/header.jpg?t=1772652957","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023, MUNDOS DESENVOLVIMENTO LTDA. All rights reserved. \"THE LIGHT OF THE DARKNESS: Classic\" is a trademark of MUNDOS DESENVOLVIMENTO LTDA. All other trademarks, logos, and copyrights are property of their respective owners.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis software is provided \"as-is\" without any express or implied warranty. In no event shall  MUNDOS DESENVOLVIMENTO LTDA be held liable for any damages arising from the use of this software.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse of this software is subject to acceptance of the MUNDOS DESENVOLVIMENTO LTDA End User License Agreement (EULA). Unauthorized copying, reverse engineering, transmission, public performance, rental, or modification of this software is strictly prohibited.<br />\r\n